# Shared by every image in the repo: the web app (./Dockerfile) and the workers
# (docker/Dockerfile.worker, docker/Dockerfile.documents). The worker images COPY
# only the paths they need, so anything listed here purely for their benefit would
# just break the web build — keep this to files no image ever wants.
node_modules
.next
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
docs
evals
fixtures
deploy
*.csv
*.md
!AGENTS.md
